    d:withinAgreement ex:Agreement .

ex:Clause13 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 13" ;
    d:clauseNumber 13 ;
    d:endChar 4617 ;
    d:exactText "13. The Distributor is an independent contractor and nothing contained in this agreement shall be deemed or interpreted to constitute the Distributor as a partner or employee of the Principal, nor shall either party have any authority to bind the other in any respect, it being understood and agreed that all orders submitted by the Distributor are subject to acceptance by Principal in its sole discretion. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 4209 .

ex:Clause3 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 3" ;
    d:clauseNumber 3 ;
    d:endChar 1818 ;
    d:exactText "3. The Distributor accepts the appointment and shall use its commercially reasonable efforts to promote, market and sell the Products within the Territory, devote such time and attention as may be reasonably necessary and abide by the Principal's policies. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 1561 .

ex:Clause7 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 7" ;
    d:clauseNumber 7 ;
    d:endChar 3006 ;
    d:exactText "7. The Distributor shall obtain at its own expense, all necessary licenses and permits to allow the Distributor to conduct business as contemplated herein. The Distributor represents and warrants that the Distributor shall conduct business in strict conformity with all local, state and federal laws, rules and regulations. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 2682 .

ex:Clause8 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 8" ;
    d:clauseNumber 8 ;
    d:endChar 3433 ;
    d:exactText "8. The Principal agrees that the Distributor may employ or engage representatives or sub-distributors in furtherance of this Agreement and the Distributor agrees that the Distributor shall be solely responsible for the payment of wages or commissions to those representatives and sub-distributors, and that under no circumstances shall Distributor's representatives be deemed employees of Principal for any purpose whatsoever. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 3006 .

ex:Termination a d:EventType ;
    rdfs:label "Early termination of this agreement; not an actual recorded termination" ;
    d:supportedBy ex:Clause10,
        ex:Clause11,
        ex:Clause12 .

ex:Clause10 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 10" ;
    d:clauseNumber 10 ;
    d:endChar 3774 ;
    d:exactText "10. This Agreement shall be in effect until March 18. 2021, unless sooner terminated by either party upon (30) days written notice, without cause. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 3627 .

ex:Clause14 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 14" ;
    d:clauseNumber 14 ;
    d:endChar 5063 ;
    d:exactText "14. It is agreed between the parties that there are no other agreements or understandings between them relating to the subject matter of this Agreement. This Agreement supersedes all prior agreements, oral or written, between the parties and is intended as a complete and exclusive statement of the agreement between the parties. No change or modification of this Agreement shall be valid unless the same be in writing and signed by the parties. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 4617 .

ex:Clause2 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 2" ;
    d:clauseNumber 2 ;
    d:endChar 1561 ;
    d:exactText """2. The Principal grants Distributor non- exclusive rights to sell these products within the countries of Romania (the "Territory"), which may be amended by mutual written agreement.

Source: PRECHECK HEALTH SERVICES, INC., 8-K, 3/20/2020





""" ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 1318 .

ex:Clause4 a d:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "Clause 4" ;
    d:clauseNumber 4 ;
    d:endChar 2005 ;
    d:exactText "4. The Principal shall maintain the right to contact and market its products to potential customers in the Territory; but agrees to pass on all sales leads and orders to the Distributor. " ;
    d:sourceDocument ex:Document ;
    d:startChar 1818 .

